  concept: "Authored objective: Settle at Station A.\nAuthored requirement: Recorded
    from measured feedback and verified carriage behavior. voltage \u2265 4.8 V.
    voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching principle: A feedback controller compares
    measured behavior with a reference and acts subject to plant dynamics and limits.\nOnly
    fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: Steering toward a target works only if the feedback accurately describes
    where you are.
